  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1771484550_6793157_25a11c21d29c012b43fa3c631e0f746b.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>About our brand and products: </strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Divage Hair is a luxury hair extension brand offering premium Remy extensions designed for seamless blending, long wear, and salon-level results.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We specialize in tape-ins, nano tips, k tips and long tape wefts and high-end shades curated for modern stylists and beauty lovers who value quality, density, and softness.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Our products are created for professionals and women who want effortless length, fullness, and confidence.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>What makes us different: </strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• We do NOT over-process our hair with heavy acid baths or silicone coating<br>• Cuticles remain aligned for minimal tangling<br>• Softness from root to tip - even in longer lengths<br>• Consistent thickness throughout the full length<br>• Premium shade matching support<br>• Designed for stylists who demand reliability</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Divage focuses on quality over mass production.<br>We are building a luxury extension community — not a discount brand.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>How affiliates can earn: </strong></p><p style=\"text-indent:0px;\">• Earn<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"> 10% </span>commission per sale<br>• High average order value = strong earnings per conversion<br>• Unique tracking link + personal discount code<br>• Tiered bonuses available for top performers<br>• No earning cap</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>How to promote us: </strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Affiliates can promote Divage through:</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• Instagram Reels &amp; transformations<br>• TikTok install videos<br>• Before/after content<br>• Client result showcases<br>• Hair care routines<br>• Pinterest content<br>• YouTube tutorials</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Authentic, educational content performs best.<br>We encourage real installs and honest reviews.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br><strong>Other information: </strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">• Open to stylists, beauty creators, and hair specialists<br>• Must align with premium brand positioning<br>• International applications welcome<br>• Applications are reviewed manually</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We prioritize long-term partnerships over one-time promotions.</p></div></div>",
